{"id": "EUVD-2026-82301", "enisaUuid": "70727bc3-3856-39f1-a1aa-c25446b30cd9", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/rockchip: analogix_dp: Fix OF node reference leak via auto cleanup\n\nSashiko reported a reference leak in rockchip_dp_drm_encoder_enable(),\nthe of_get_child_by_name() function does not call of_node_put() in a\nsymmetrical way [1].\n\nFix the device node reference leak by using __free(device_node) to\nautomatically manage of_node_put() for all device nodes.", "datePublished": "2026-09-17T16:12:17", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:07:05", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/396a193867c6e8ee810287d6f79624144b5629e9", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/887315e5d2eb87c3d6d0da9f7610bc5b3113ae30", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/87e060521371257ddbb77964b66e60d80afcc7b2"], "aliases": ["GHSA-f539-4xw9-gw39", "CVE-2026-93193"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "4379d1d0-5bcd-34ed-86df-740bedc8e4b9", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.6"}, {"id": "624173cf-a953-37aa-a07f-01e27beb26dd", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "729f8eefdcadaff98606931e691910f17d8d59d6 <396a193867c6e8ee810287d6f79624144b5629e9"}, {"id": "64a8f92d-c847-3e2f-b6f8-4cbfa78e9951", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "729f8eefdcadaff98606931e691910f17d8d59d6 <87e060521371257ddbb77964b66e60d80afcc7b2"}, {"id": "9b70b021-0535-33e5-9d29-e627a3832ef2", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "9f5c529d-5dd1-306b-a965-2e278ee5e61b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "729f8eefdcadaff98606931e691910f17d8d59d6 <887315e5d2eb87c3d6d0da9f7610bc5b3113ae30"}, {"id": "acdc5836-4175-34a2-beb8-cb437054726c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}